#: scenario:scenario_EC2E5E21_2713_47FA_833C_90F538C46B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecdcce9ec55991a368c332e8dd80885282278ba3a1109a32964f37c75b8dd660
