#: scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b67b0ab806d5baefe81994432c4d0c195bd5a8e0db8086e8b93af8936b7472d
#. default-sha256: bc166fdf980a14639d53670370cbdf95db60e3ca5945368c26cb35e7960b4c1d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The "
"only sounds that could be heard in the dark corridors were the sharp pitter-patter of the rain, "
"his footsteps, and his breathing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Os "
"únicos sons que podiam ser escutados nos corredores escuros eram o pesado tamborilar da chuva, "
"seus passos e sua respiração."

#: scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdd4b784ec0aa2d6ebf8bd68ec09c7b5634ddbdf30f48c2e8ddf42db45696964
#. default-sha256: 5f2cdc3cf14ad991607e371de3d219fca5b2e2ff59ef70d4ea8ea27a53d8cb21
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was intimately familiar with the layout of the house, that night, the hallways "
"felt like an endless labyrinth veiled in shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora fosse intimamente familiar com a disposição da casa, naquela noite, os corredores "
"pareciam um labirinto interminável velado nas sombras."

#: scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c2e90f40a886e2b845888b208db4750642af9be92dd4410cd4da14f7a7d588c
#. default-sha256: 90c4212896e84ff22fbc67fbc54298b419176d877d95c87abfd0e4618543b574
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No moonlight shone through the windows, so he naturally found himself moving cautiously, "
"despite being in his own residence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O luar não brilhava pela janela, então naturalmente ele se viu movendo cautelosamente, mesmo "
"estando na sua própria residência."

#: scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 589f5eede1310bf9762567104c60f20782ef65c83de535d7df1879a39878ac5f
#. default-sha256: b0fa83cd2010abd70ba3fd91670cf19c78930dfd6cb18aeb9e6bef95333feb66
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Keeping the palm of his hand pressed up against the chilly wall, he put one foot in front of "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mantendo a palma da mão pressionada contra a parede fria, ele seguiu um pé após o outro."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 738cf1ff6e57572b931f975faadbbe12f82b31f44138382ba5d1ce96cc1b64d1
#. default-sha256: cdfdb88cdbc6a0a7f5b88c87550a4aa24febb9eb91933a61641e8a94403d80e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to where was he supposed to head?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, of course, had no way of answering that "
"question himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas para onde ele deveria ir?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, obviamente, não tinha como responder a essa "
"pergunta por si mesmo."

#: scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc662adeaf13fbf4fdb1e418d9edd701864dfbfa402d06fc738c9cdc0e9bbd9c
#. default-sha256: 748c9cdadcaab311476aa8651d3761111e284a76201eae43f09d1ab843ffc15a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he had anything... ⟪k:1⟫it was guidance from above—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the path to his destination "
"lit by flashes of lightning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se havia alguma coisa... ⟪k:1⟫era orientação de cima—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫o caminho para seu destino "
"iluminado por flashes de relâmpagos."

#: scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b450a85ad1ca0904c90082e8819e73a624ce2de5c2ce565d093ac383126f8a75
#. default-sha256: 39f4e159ac3db639ad14d5e0ea046f2c98b8427433d6f45a7e6c96aead4a0299
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps there was something else leading him along."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou talvez houvesse outra coisa guiando ele."

#: scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48e31a990e14e49f74d9d72dd85386a022a7049163ab57c140ccc2b3c371cf72
#. default-sha256: c9041ca1923d0707abb15ba73ad5b0a8fb09e5c8ed5e3218d4dcb5aaaf70bc87
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he progressed with a fair bit of hesitation in his step, Mell was slowly but surely "
"drawing nearer to one room in particular."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora seguisse com grande hesitação, Mell estava sendo atraído devagar, mas "
"indiscutivelmente, para um quarto em particular."

#: scenario:scenario_F42B0957_BF80_4AD8_A18B_938E16BEEA60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce981fd9e503dde8eb617b99d794c9d0ea12a63ab419f8e49888cd147f791f01
#. default-sha256: f81d845d99447b5e987603ff804357037c42523590ba677302b347d18bb2b0fb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F42B0957_BF80_4AD8_A18B_938E16BEEA60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He made his way through the seemingly endless halls..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele seguiu seu caminho pelos aparentemente infinitos corredores..."

